# Next.js App Router Standards

- Treat this codebase as a non-standard Next.js setup; do not assume legacy patterns.
- Before implementing framework-level changes, read relevant docs in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` and follow deprecation guidance.
- Prefer App Router conventions (`app/` routes, server-first components, explicit client boundaries).
- Keep components accessible by default (semantic structure, keyboard support, visible focus, readable text contrast).
- Use concise, maintainable TSX and avoid over-abstracting one-off UI logic.
- Preserve existing project patterns before introducing new conventions.
